Internal digest_reg right after Scenario A's hash op (probed directly, pre-register-file): 0xe3c455e4cad114dee4a1b29a5586a78c3deba0578109660de66bb722b773265e
Scenario A (debug LOCKED, D=0): SHA256_DIGEST readback:
